++  test-perf-queue
  ::  hot path: queue  (safety engine)
  ::  measured median: 2136 ms median of 15 runs (R2.8.1a: 5 warm + 5 fresh-boot + 5 post-rebuild)
  %+  expect-eq
    !>  [1.153 576 0 47 [0 1 1 2]]
  !>  (prof '---- MODULE A ----\0a\\* Hot path: the BFS QUEUE. A 24x24 grid walked one axis at a time -- many\0a\\* states carrying trivial values, so the cost is enqueue / dedup /\0a\\* fingerprint-set membership rather than evaluation.\0aEXTENDS Integers\0aVARIABLES x, y\0aInit == x = 0 /\\ y = 0\0aNext == \\/ /\\ x\' = (x + 1) % 24\0a           /\\ y\' = y\0a        \\/ /\\ y\' = (y + 1) % 24\0a           /\\ x\' = x\0aInv  == x < 24 /\\ y < 24\0a====\0a' 'INIT Init\0aNEXT Next\0aINVARIANT Inv\0a')
